{"id":"e8de756444081284","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-closure-operator.md","title":"Closure Operator","display":"df-closure-operator — Closure Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-closure-operator","aliases":["57-df-closure-operator"],"display":"df-closure-operator — Closure Operator","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-closure-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-closure-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closure-operator — Closure Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-closure-operator-—-Closure-Operator-$\\mathrm{cl}$\">df-closure-operator — Closure Operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cl}\">\\(\\mathrm{cl}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\subseteq A\">\\(X,Y\\subseteq A\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\">\\(C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\)</span> 按自然数递归。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span> 是本原子由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(C_n^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 的递归定义引入的闭包算子；签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 与结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 固定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC_0^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\cup\\{c^{\\mathfrak A}:c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\},\\\\\nC_{n+1}^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\cup\n\\{f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a):k\\ge1\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\land\\vec a\\in(C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X))^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X),\\\\\nX&amp;\\subseteq\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\subseteq A,\\\\\nX\\subseteq Y&amp;\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\subseteq\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X))&amp;=\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC_0^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\cup\\{c^{\\mathfrak A}:c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\},\\\\\nC_{n+1}^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\cup\n\\{f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a):k\\ge1\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\land\\vec a\\in(C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X))^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X),\\\\\nX&amp;\\subseteq\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\subseteq A,\\\\\nX\\subseteq Y&amp;\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\subseteq\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X))&amp;=\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不再把只对符号定义的 ar 应用于任意项。若 X 与常量集都为空，闭包可以为空；只有非空闭包才给出本册要求非空论域的子结构。Skolem 闭包必须使用已经解释了新函数的扩张结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-closure-operator-—-Closure-Operator-$\\mathrm{cl}$","text":"df-closure-operator — Closure Operator $\\mathrm{cl}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$X,Y\\subseteq A$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$\\mathrm{Const}_S$ 和 $\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)$ 按自然数递归。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$X,Y\\subseteq A$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$\\mathrm{Const}_S$ 和 $\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)$ 按自然数递归。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"C_n^{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nC_0^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&\\coloneqq X\\cup\\{c^{\\mathfrak A}:c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\},\\\\\nC_{n+1}^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&\\coloneqq C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\cup\n\\{f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a):k\\ge1\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\land\\vec a\\in(C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X))^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}C_n^{\\mathfrak A}(X),\\\\\nX&\\subseteq\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\subseteq A,\\\\\nX\\subseteq Y&\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\subseteq\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X))&=\\mathrm{cl}_S^{\\mathfrak A}(X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1660,"backlinks":[{"id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)$ 为候选闭包算子，见 [[57-df-closure-operator]]；$\\mathcal L$ 为候选演绎系统。$\\mathrm{AbstractLogic_{AAL}}$ 保留原来的结构性演绎系统类，而不是另一个带模型语义的抽象逻辑对象。"},{"id":"6965d045e3a44cd2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里闭包的是函数对象集合。它不同于 [[57-df-closure-operator]] 的结构载体生成闭包；后者的文件、对象和调用名均未更改。"},{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"补齐原来仅在缺失外册中给名的全算子族；正元基底、二参数 Closure 调用和 PR 函数类不变。原 [[57-df-closure-operator]] 的结构生成闭包没有被替换。"},{"id":"e91afa7b7e5241b9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$X\\subseteq A$。自由变量和变量的固定枚举见 [[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{cl}$ 见 [[57-df-closure-operator]]。"},{"id":"731def36513a770d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-closure-operator]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57